### Secrets / local environment (TASK-012) ###
# Real credentials and local-only overrides must never be versioned. Files
# ending in .example (e.g. application-prod.properties.example, .env.example)
# are documentation - placeholders only - and are intentionally NOT matched
# by any pattern below. application-dev.properties and application-test.properties
# are also intentionally NOT ignored: both contain only ${VAR} placeholders/
# safe test defaults, never a real secret, and must stay versioned.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
application-local.properties
application-secret.properties
application-prod.properties
secrets/
*.key
*.pem
